{
  "Areas.VolcanicCrag.Description": "You walk for some time, roaming the hard-packed and pink-tinged earth of the demon-realm of Mareth. As you progress, you can feel the air getting warm. It gets hotter as you progress until you finally stumble across a blackened landscape. You reward yourself with a sight of the endless series of a volcanic landscape. Crags dot the landscape.[pg]"
  "Areas.VolcanicCrag.Discovery": "You walk for some time, roaming the hard-packed and pink-tinged earth of the demon-realm of Mareth. As you progress, you can feel the air getting warm. It gets hotter as you progress until you finally stumble across a blackened landscape. You reward yourself with a sight of the endless series of a volcanic landscape. Crags dot the landscape.[pg]\n<b>You've discovered the Volcanic Crag!</b>"
  "Areas.VolcanicCrag.Explore": "You spend an hour exploring the volcaniccrag."
  "Areas.VolcanicCrag.Name": "VolcanicCrag"
}
